Output public/pages/prompts/interrogate/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 39ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/prompts/interrogate"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "/subagents on"
Enter
Sleep 1900ms
# cue: start
Type "/interrogate Check shout and defaults"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 3300ms
# cue: seats
Sleep 7800ms
# cue: rerun
Sleep 2600ms
# cue: result
Sleep 8000ms
